  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 570f073b49457d647ad7eacd7abba8f9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - What's up, student? I have a free minute and I hope you're doing well.
  - The most important thing is, don't keep the client waiting! Everyone has their
    own things to do, so it's crucial to complete them on time. You can accept the
    next client by ringing the bell.
  - You know, gossip spreads fast in our community. Every improperly brewed potion
    or late-delivered order lowers your reputation, so try not to make mistakes.
  - I think I should run now...
  characterIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad864c0ad8fea674b922ba8cc177ee40, type: 3}
  autoAdvanceDelay: 4
